# What is expected to be irregular here, and why.
#
#   path/          a path -- a trailing slash matches everything beneath it
#   !checkname     a whole check, disabled for this skill only
#
# Both are reported in the output rather than hidden: a silenced check nobody
# can see is a check nobody will ever reconsider. Keep the reason specific
# enough that the next reader can tell whether it still holds.

scripts/templates/   # Template fragments hold unsubstituted tokens by design, and cite paths that exist only in the generated skill

!version             # This configurator is versioned with the repository CHANGELOG, not with the conventions it sets up -- it builds the collection rather than belonging to it
